<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">Rough: John Mark, Aug 02.</book>
  <para style="h">Tɛsaloniki II</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ala xa masenyi firin nde Annabi Pɔlu naxan sɛbɛ Tɛsaloniki danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama ma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tɛsaloniki II</para>
  <para style="mt">Ala xa masenyi firin nde</para>
  <para style="mt">Annabi Pɔlu naxan sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="mt">Tɛsaloniki danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama ma</para>
  <para style="imt">Masenyi nde yi Kitaabui xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="ip">Yi Kitaabui findixi bataaxɛ firin nde nan na Ala xa xɛɛra Pɔlu nun a walibooree naxan sɛbɛ danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama ma naxee nu sabatixi Tɛsaloniki. Fe naxee nu dangife Tɛsaloniki Pɔlu bataaxɛ singe sɛbɛ tɛmui, nee to mu nu gɛxi ya ibade, Pɔlu naxa gbilen bataaxɛ firin nde sɛbɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mixi kobi naxee nu na Tɛsaloniki danxaniyatɔɛe ɲaxankatafe, e mu nu ɲaxankatɛ itixi. Na kui, Pɔlu naxa gbilen danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama ralimaniya ra a xa yi bataaxɛ firin nde kui. A naxa e rasi e xa e tunnabɛxi danxaniya kira xɔn ma, e naxa tagan wali fanyi rabade, e xa bira Ala xa nɔndi fɔxɔ ra alɔ Pɔlu e kawandi ki naxɛ. Pɔlu nu bara a mɛ, a mixi ndee nu na e ya ma naxee mu nu tinma walide alako e xa e yɛtɛ baloe sɔtɔ. Na kui, a naxa na kanyie rasi a xɔrɔxɔɛ ra e xa ba na ma, e naxa e xa kɔntɔfili dɔxɔ mixi gbɛtɛ yo xun ma. Pɔlu man nu bara a mɛ a Tɛsaloniki danxaniyatɔɛe nu bara xibaaru sɔtɔ mixi nde ra, a Marigi fa lɔxɔɛ ɲan nu bara a li. Na kui, a naxa nɔndi makɛnɛn e bɛ na fe ma, a Marigi xa lɔxɔɛ mu a lima fo fe ndee raba sinden Ala naxee ragirixi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yi Kitaabui findixi masenyi nan na Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi naxan fi Pɔlu ma Tɛsaloniki danxaniyatɔɛe nun danxaniyatɔɛe birin bɛ. Ala xa won mali yi masenyi xa so won xaxili kui, won xa a rasabati won bɔɲɛ kui. Ala xa sɛnbɛ fi won ma, won ma wali nun wɔyɛnyi birin xa findi a fanyi nan na. Ala xa won sondonyie xun ti kira fanyi xɔn, won xa won ɲɛrɛ Ala xa xanunteya ma nun a xa Mixi Sugandixi xa tunnabɛxiya ma. Ala xa won mali won sanyie xa xan danxaniya kui. Amina.</para>
  <para style="imte">Ala xa masenyi firin nde</para>
  <para style="imte">Annabi Pɔlu naxan sɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="imte">Tɛsaloniki danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama ma</para>
  <para style="cl">Sora</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="s">Xɛɛbui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Pɔlu, Silifanu, nun Timote nan yi ki, katarabi won Baba Ala nun Marigi Isa Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi xa danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama ma naxee na Tɛsaloniki.<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Won Baba Ala nun a xa Mixi Sugandixi Marigi Isa xa hinnɛ nun bɔɲɛsa fi wo ma.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ala duniɲa birin makiitife tinxinyi kui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />N ngaxakerenyie, muxu lanma muxu xa Ala tantu wo xa fe ra tɛmui birin. Muxu xa tantui lanxi barima wo xa danxaniya xun masafe ki fanyi, a nun wo xa xanunteya wo bore bɛ. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Na kui, muxu wo matɔxɔma Ala xa danxaniyatɔɛ ɲamae bɛ wo xa tunnabɛxiya nun danxaniya xa fe ra wo naxee masenfe wo xa ɲaxankatɛ nun tɔɔrɛ birin kui.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Na bara Ala xa kiiti tinxinxi masen, barima wo na naxan iminife, na nan a masenma a wo daxa wo xa lu Ala xa mangɛya niini bun ma, wo tɔɔrɔfe naxan xa fe ra. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Ala tinxin. Mixi naxee wo ɲaxankatama, a e sare fima ɲaxankatɛ nan na. <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />Wo tan naxee bara ɲaxankata, a malabui fima nɛ won birin ma Marigi Isa a nun a xa malekɛ sɛnbɛmae fama tɛmui naxɛ kelife koore ma. <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />E nun tɛ wolenxi nan goroma. Ala kolontaree, naxee mu won Marigi Isa xa masenyi rabatuma, e sare fima ɲaxankatɛ nan na. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Na mixie xa kiiti findima gbaloe nan na dande yo mu naxan ma. Marigi e makuyama nɛ a yɛtɛ ra nun a sɛnbɛ nɔrɔxi ra <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />a na fa tɛmui naxɛ. Na lɔxɔɛ a xa sɛniyɛntɔɛe nun a mantonyie birin a toma nɛ, e kaaba, e a matɔxɔ. Wo fan luma nɛ nee ya ma, barima wo danxaniya nɛ muxu xa seedeɲɔxɔya ma.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Na kui, muxu Ala maxandima wo bɛ tɛmui birin, alako won Marigi Ala xa wo lu alɔ a mixi naxan xilixi na daxa ki naxɛ. Muxu man a maxandima a xa wo xa ɲanige fanyi birin nakamali a nun wo xa wali fanyi naxee kelima wo xa danxaniya ma. Na rabama a sɛnbɛ nan saabui ra. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Muxu na maxandi tima alako Marigi Isa xa matɔxɔɛ sɔtɔ wo saabui ra, wo fan xa matɔxɔɛ sɔtɔ Isa ra. Yi birin nabama Ala nun a xa Mixi Sugandixi Marigi Isa xa hinnɛ saabui nan na.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Xɛmɛ sɛriyɛtare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />N ngaxakerenyie, muxu bara wo mayandi wo bɔɲɛ naxa mini wo to fee mɛma won Marigi Isa fa lɔxɔɛ xa fe ra, a nun won fama a ralande ki naxɛ. <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />Xa mixi nde a fala wo bɛ a Marigi xa lɔxɔɛ ɲan bara fa, wo xaxili naxa ifu de! Wo naxa la a ra hali na kanyi wɔyɛn wo bɛ alɔ namiɲɔnmɛ na a ra, xa na mu a kawandi ti wo bɛ, xa na mu a fa bataaxɛ ra alɔ a fatanxi muxu tan nan na. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Wo naxa a lu mixi yo xa wo madaxu. Na lɔxɔɛ mu a lima fo adamadi gbegbe mɛɛ Ala ra sinden, a nun, Sɛriyɛtare Xungbe, a naxa makɛnɛn, gbaloe ragataxi naxan bɛ. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />A fama nɛ a yɛtɛ itede dangi adamadie xa batuse birin na. Adamadie sese xili falama «ala», a tan tima nɛ na kanke. Na kui, a fama nɛ dɔxɔde Ala xa hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, a a yɛtɛ findi ala ra. <verse eid="2TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />N to yi fee fala wo bɛ n nu na wo yire tɛmui naxɛ, wo nɛɛmuxi nɛ? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Yakɔsi wo a kolon naxan makankanxi Sɛriyɛtare Xungbe ma, alako a naxa mini beenun a xa waxati xa a li. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Sɛriyɛtareya ɲan na walife nɔxunyi kui. A luma na ki nɛ han naxan a makankanxi a a bama naa tɛmui naxɛ. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Na tɛmui, Sɛriyɛtare Xungbe makɛnɛnma nɛ. Marigi na fa tɛmui naxɛ, a yi xɛmɛ halakima nɛ a dɛ foye ra, a xa fa nɔrɛ a sɔntɔma nɛ. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Yi Sɛriyɛtare Xungbe minima Sentanɛ sɛnbɛ nan saabui ra, a fa kaabanakoe, tɔnxumae, nun fe magaaxuxie raba naxee mu findixi nɔndi ra. <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />A fama nɛ mixi kisitaree mayendende fe ɲaaxi mɔɔli birin na, barima nɔndi mu rafan nee ma. Na na a ra e mu kisima. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Na kui, Ala e xaxili ifuma nɛ sɛnbɛ ra, alako e xa la wule ra. <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />A rabama na ki nɛ alako mixi birin xa gbaloe sɔtɔ naxee mu danxaniyaxi nɔndi ma, tinxintareya rafanxi naxee ma.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ala xa xanunteya nun a xa kisi danxaniyatɔɛe bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Kɔnɔ n ngaxakerenyie, fo muxu xa Ala tantu wo xa fe ra tɛmui birin. Marigi wo xanuxi nɛ. Kabi fe fɔlɔ fɔlɛ, Ala bara wo sugandi alako wo xa kisi. A wo rakisima a Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi xa wali nan saabui ra naxan wo rasɛniyɛnma, a nun wo xa danxaniya saabui ra wo to danxaniyaxi nɔndi ma. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />A wo xilixi na nan ma. A wo xilixi muxu xa xibaaru fanyi xa kawandi nan saabui ra alako wo xa xunnakeli sɔtɔ naxan kelima Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi ma, won Marigi Isa. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Na kui, n ngaxakerenyie, wo sanyie xa xan danxaniya kui. Muxu wo xaran naxan na muxu xa kawandi nun bataaxɛ saabui ra, wo xa na suxu gben.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Won Marigi Isa yɛtɛ yati, naxan findixi Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi ra, nun won Baba Ala, naxan bara won xanu, naxan hinnɛma won na alako limaniya nun xaxili tide naxa ba won yi ra abadan, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />e xa wo sondonyie ralimaniya. E man xa sɛnbɛ fi wo ma, wo xa wali nun wɔyɛnyi birin xa findi a fanyi ra.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s">Ala maxandife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />N ngaxakerenyie, a dɔnxɔɛ ra, wo Ala maxandi muxu bɛ alako Marigi xa masenyi xa yensen yɛ mafuren na, a man xa binya yire birin alɔ a binyaxi wo xɔnyi ki naxɛ. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Wo Ala maxandi muxu man xa ba mixi kobie nun mixi ɲaaxie bɛlɛxɛ, barima mixi birin xa mu danxaniyaxi. <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Kɔnɔ Ala na a xui xanbi ra. A sɛnbɛ fima nɛ wo ma, a wo ratanga Sentanɛ ma. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Muxu laxi a ra Marigi saabui ra, a muxu yaamari naxee fixi wo ma, wo e rabatuma nɛ alɔ wo ɲan na rabafe ki naxɛ. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Marigi xa wo sondonyie xun ti kira fanyi xɔn alako wo xa Ala xanu, wo man xa wo tunnabɛxi alɔ Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi a rabaxi ki naxɛ.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tunnaxɔnɛe rasife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />N ngaxakerenyie, muxu bara wo yamari won Marigi Isa Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi xili ra wo xa wo makuya danxaniyatɔɛe ra naxee findixi tunnaxɔnɛe ra. Na kui, e mu ɲɛrɛfe muxu xa masenyi ma muxu fa naxan na wo xɔn. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Wo a kolon yati wo lanma wo xa muxu fɔxi raba ki naxɛ. Muxu to nu na wo ya ma muxu mu findi tunnaxɔnɛe xa ra, <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />muxu man mu mixi yo xa bande don a fa lu muxu mu a sare fi. Muxu wakili nɛ kɔɛ nun yanyi ra, alako muxu xa fe naxa findi kote ra wo sese bɛ. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Muxu nu nɔma muxu xa kɔntɔfili sade wo ya i, kɔnɔ muxu mu tin na ra alako muxu xa findi misaali ra wo bɛ, wo fan xa muxu fɔxi raba. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Muxu nu na wo ya ma tɛmui naxɛ, muxu yi yaamari nan fi wo ma: «Naxan yo mu tinma walide, hali wo mu na kanyi ki bande.» <verse eid="2TH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Muxu bara a mɛ a mixi ndee wo ya ma e bara e yɛtɛ findi tunnaxɔnɛe ra. E mu wali yo suxuma bafe naafixiya ra. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Muxu bara na mixie yamari, muxu e rasi Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi won Marigi Isa xili ra, e xa wali bɔɲɛsa kui alako e xa nɔ e yɛtɛ balode.<verse eid="2TH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />N ngaxakerenyie, wo naxa tagan fe fanyi rabafe ma. <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Wo a mato a fanyi ra, xa mixi nde mu tin muxu xa masenyi danxunde muxu naxan sɛbɛxi yi bataaxɛ kui, dɛfanyi naxa lu wo nun na kanyi tagi alako a xa yaagi. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Wo naxa a findi wo yaxui ra de, kɔnɔ wo xa a rasi alɔ wo ngaxakerenyi.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Xɛɛbui dɔnxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />N bara Marigi maxandi naxan findixi bɔɲɛsa kanyi ra, a tan yɛtɛ yati xa bɔɲɛsa fi wo ma tɛmui birin nun a mɔɔli birin na. Marigi xa lu wo birin sɛɛti ma.<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />N tan Pɔlu nan yi xɛɛbui sɛbɛfe n yɛtɛ bɛlɛxɛ ra. N ma bataaxɛ birin matɔnxumaxi yi ki nɛ. N bɛlɛxɛ fɔxi nan ya.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Won Marigi Isa, Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi, a xa hinnɛ xa lu wo birin bɛ.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>